{"id":"f81148ddb9a8ee2f","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pointhull.md","title":"Boolean subcube hull of two points","display":"df-pointhull — Boolean subcube hull of two points","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pointhull","aliases":["27-df-pointhull"],"display":"df-pointhull — Boolean subcube hull of two points","depends_on":["[[27-df-vardom]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§3.2.1 Definition 3.1","source_printed_pages":"128","source_pdf_pages":"152","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pointhull"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pointhull</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pointhull — Boolean subcube hull of two points"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.2.1 Definition 3.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"128"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"152"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 及布尔向量的坐标域见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,z,a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(y,z,a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，空积等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)\\)</span> 是下节构造的布尔函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in[n]:\\,y_i=z_i=1}a_i\\prod_{j\\in[n]:\\,y_j=z_j=0}(1-a_j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in[n]:\\,y_i=z_i=1}a_i\\prod_{j\\in[n]:\\,y_j=z_j=0}(1-a_j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_n(y,z)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)(a)=1\\}=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(y_i=z_i\\Rightarrow a_i=y_i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal H_n(y,z)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)(a)=1\\}=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(y_i=z_i\\Rightarrow a_i=y_i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两点相同的坐标被固定，其他坐标自由，因而该集合是包含两点的最小轴平行子立方体。Hull 是项函数，H 是它的真点集，两者不能混淆。这里的 hull 不是实向量空间中的线段或凸包。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-vardom]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[n]$ 及布尔向量的坐标域见 [[27-df-vardom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"y,z,a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in[n]:\\,y_i=z_i=1}a_i\\prod_{j\\in[n]:\\,y_j=z_j=0}(1-a_j).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_n(y,z)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)(a)=1\\}=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(y_i=z_i\\Rightarrow a_i=y_i)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1571,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pointhull|df-pointhull — Boolean subcube hull of two points]]"},{"id":"72010080dc80185b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$P,N\\subseteq[n]$、$P\\cap N=\\varnothing$；$C:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 由下式构造。$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(C(a)\\le f(a))$，$y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$、$C(y)=1$；$\\mathrm{Hull}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pointhull]]。"},{"id":"5a0b601b375ead95","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$T=\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}$、$m=|T|$。$\\mathrm{Imp}(f),\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-impset]]、[[27-df-piset]]；$\\mathrm{Hull}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pointhull]]。"}],"outgoing":["4b84ee77aaf0c828"]}